==Description==
{{Description|This enemy has a {{Color|help|higher RES|nobold=1}} to {{Color|[[Spectro]] DMG|nobold=1}}.<br /><br />When the Voidwing Moth recovers from Immobilization, it cycles between the Wings Spread, Wings Folded, and Curled Up states.<br>While in the Wings Spread state, its Vibration Strength reduces faster.<br>While in the Wings Folded State, it takes less Vibration Strength reduction, and 30% less total DMG.<br>While in the Curled Up state, it takes 50% more total DMG.<br><br>A unique TD endemic to the Dimmr Plains, often seen in areas heavily contaminated by Voidmatter. it assumes a moth-like form with wings that shed Voidmatter particles.<br>Moving with instinct under the influence of Voidmatter, these creatures were once the vanguard of Aleph-1's incursion.<br>Though naturally passive, it will stop at nothing to annihilate its target once aggravated.|Description when discovered}}

